Send requests for `openstack_config_file_path` configurations through the REST client instead of openstacksdk, which restores Heat, Swift, Cinder, Ironic port group and Neutron quota metrics, and keep requesting each resource at the microversion openstacksdk chose when `nova_microversion`, `ironic_microversion` or `cinder_microversion` is unset. Follow pagination when `paginated_limit` is unset, support identity endpoints registered with a `/v3` suffix, and tag server flavor metrics with `flavor_id` and `flavor_name` from Nova microversion 2.47.
